title: "Silent failure in variant interpretation: how missing gnomAD frequencies distort ACMG/AMP evidence in sarcomere cardiomyopathy genes"
abstract: "Measures how missing gnomAD allele frequencies change the ACMG/AMP frequency criteria (BA1, BS1, PM2) for ClinVar variants in eight sarcomere genes, with a sensitivity analysis of the BS1 threshold."
